  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Agent Instructions**\n\nI\'m now diving into Phase 3 of the planning workflow. The focus is on the Agent Instructions, specifically the \"First Turn\" actions. I need to make sure the app name in `metadata.json` is updated (if it\'s a placeholder), and that the HTML title and meta descriptions sync up correctly.\n\n\n**Synchronizing HTML Metadata**\n\nI\'m now cross-referencing the `metadata.json` with the HTML\'s `og:title` and `og:description` tags to ensure they are synchronized. I also need to begin the parallel image generation workflow. I will focus on optimizing image generation for `hero_golden_oil_pour`, `flaxseed_oil_spotlight` and `camellia_oil_spotlight` and making sure it uses a single batch generation call to emit all `generate_image` tool calls together.\n\n\n**Generating Image Variants**\n\nI\'m now generating images. I have two new image prompts for this round: one featuring a dark glass bottle of camellia oil with blossoms and seeds, and another of a lab-quality still-life with oil, a pipette, and botanical elements. I\'ll make sure to execute all four calls to `generate_image` together, and, in this turn, I will also update `metadata.json` and `index.html`. I\'ll set the name and description in `metadata.json` to the specified values.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_275711"
      name: "generate_image"
      arguments_json: "{\"AspectRatio\":\"16:9\",\"ImageName\":\"hero_golden_oil_pour\",\"Prompt\":\"Macro editorial photography of pure golden cold-pressed botanical oil pouring gracefully into a handcrafted ceramic tasting spoon, surrounded by subtle fresh camellia blossoms and golden flax seeds, warm natural morning window lighting, shallow depth of field, 8k commercial quality, minimalist luxury wellness aesthetic.\",\"toolAction\":\"Generating image\",\"toolSummary\":\"Generate hero banner image for healthy oil encyclopedia\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "generate_image"
    }
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_275726"
      name: "generate_image"
      arguments_json: "{\"AspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"ImageName\":\"flaxseed_oil_spotlight\",\"Prompt\":\"Studio still-life product photography of pure amber cold-pressed flaxseed oil in an apothecary dark amber glass bottle, delicate blue flax flowers (Linum usitatissimum) and raw golden flaxseeds scattered on a warm limestone surface, soft diffused side lighting, clean editorial wellness aesthetic.\",\"toolAction\":\"Generating image\",\"toolSummary\":\"Generate flaxseed oil spotlight photo\"}"
      original_name: "generate_image"
    }
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_275735"
      name: "generate_image"
      arguments_json: "{\"AspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"ImageName\":\"camellia_oil_spotlight\",\"Prompt\":\"Studio still-life photography of cold-pressed virgin Camellia oleifera seed oil (tea seed oil) in a minimalist dark emerald glass dropper bottle, fresh white camellia flower with yellow stamens and whole camellia seeds on natural slate, clean tranquil lighting, Japanese-Taiwanese wabi-sabi tea culture aesthetic.\",\"toolAction\":\"Generating image\",\"toolSummary\":\"Generate camellia seed oil spotlight photo\"}"
