  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Structure**\n\nI\'m currently focused on structuring the codebase cleanly. I\'ve started designing the components and data modules. I\'m building `src/data/oilData.ts` to hold a detailed database of 14 edible oils. I\'ve already included flaxseed oil with its smoke point and ALA content. I\'m planning out the remaining entries.\n\n\n**Expanding the Oil Database**\n\nI\'ve just added several new oils to the database, expanding the focus and depth of the oil database. I\'ve integrated details for Bitter Tea Oil, Extra Virgin Olive Oil, Avocado Oil, Perilla Oil, Walnut Oil, Sesame Oil (both cold-pressed and toasted), Canola Oil, and Peanut Oil. I have now included information on smoke points, fatty acid compositions, and suggested uses for each, enriching the data and providing more comprehensive options.\n\n\n**Adding More Oils**\n\nI\'ve just added several more oils, and I\'m detailing out the data entries. I\'ve included smoke points and usage tips for Peanut, Sunflower (both standard and high-oleic), Soybean, Coconut (virgin and refined), Lard, and Ghee. I\'m focusing on fatty acid breakdowns and health considerations, including Omega-3 and Omega-6 ratios.\n\n\n**Analyzing Fatty Acid Profiles**\n\nI\'m now diving into the fatty acid profiles. I\'m focusing on the Omega-3 to Omega-6 ratio, highlighting the modern imbalance caused by seed oils and comparing it to ancestral diets. I\'m exploring the benefits of Omega-9 and its heat stability, and I\'m looking at Camellia oil and extra virgin olive oil examples.\n\nI\'m also working on `src/data/researchData.ts`, curating peer-reviewed papers. I\'ve begun with research from NEJM on the Mediterranean diet, the AHA meta-analysis on linolenic and oleic acids, research on Camellia oil, and a recent paper from The Lancet on plant-based Omega-3s.\n\n\n**Curating Relevant Studies**\n\nI\'ve just added cohort studies on longevity and all-cause mortality. I\'m also including a Taiwan MOHW study on dietary fat intake and metabolic syndrome. I\'ve found a Food Chemistry paper on thermal oxidation stability, comparing Camellia, flaxseed, and other seed oils.\n\n\\n\\n\n\n**Designing Component Structure**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the components. I\'m designing the Navbar with a top bar, clean nav links, and a primary button. I\'m building a mobile-responsive drawer with accessible toggles. I\'ve also started working on the Hero section with editorial typography, an SVG visual, a golden ratio KPI strip, and jump buttons.\n\nI\'ve also begun to explore the FattyAcidSection with an interactive breakdown of Omega-3, 6, 9. I\'m also preparing a visual metabolic pathway comparison for anti-inflammatory versus pro-inflammatory pathways.\n\n\n**Developing Interactive Tools**\n\nI\'m now building an interactive Cooking Oil Matcher based on cooking techniques and health goals. I\'m also creating a smoke point visual scale. I\'m developing a searchable, filterable oil database table, with data on fatty acid ratios and cooking suitability. I am also working on a modern dietary imbalance chart with restoration recommendations.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_267861"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"export interface FattyAcid {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  chemicalName: string;\\n  category: \'Omega-3\' | \'Omega-6\' | \'Omega-9\';\\n  type: \'\345\244\232\345\205\203\344\270\215\351\243\275\345\222\214 (PUFA)\' | \'\345\226\256\345\205\203\344\270\215\351\243\275\345\222\214 (MUFA)\';\\n  isEssential: boolean;\\n  idealDailyIntake: string;\\n  biologicalAction: \'\345\274\267\346\225\210\346\212\227\347\231\274\347\202\216 / \351\231\215\350\241\200\346\240\223\' | \'\344\277\203\347\231\274\347\202\216\351\230\262\347\246\246 / \350\252\277\346\216\247\345\205\215\347\226\253\' | \'\345\277\203\350\241\200\347\256\241\347\266\255\350\255\267 / \346\212\227\346\260\247\345\214\226\347\251\251\345\256\232\';\\n  modernIntakeStatus: \'\345\232\264\351\207\215\346\224\235\345\217\226\344\270\215\350\266\263\357\274\210\345\271\263\345\235\207\344\270\215\350\266\263 30%\357\274\211\' | \'\345\232\264\351\207\215\351\201\216\351\207\217\357\274\210\350\266\205\346\250\231 3~5 \345\200\215\357\274\211\' | \'\346\224\235\345\217\226\345\201\217\344\275\216\346\210\226\351\201\251\344\270\255\';\\n  metabolicPathway: string;\\n  keyMolecules: string[];\\n  primaryFoodSources: string[];\\n  healthBenefits: string[];\\n  clinicalRisksOfImbalance: string;\\n  cookingPrecaution: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport const FATTY_ACIDS_DATA: FattyAcid[] = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'omega-3\',\\n    name: \'Omega-3 \350\204\202\350\202\252\351\205\270\',\\n    chemicalName: \'\316\261-\344\272\236\351\272\273\351\205\270 (ALA) / EPA / DHA\',\\n    category: \'Omega-3\',\\n    type: \'\345\244\232\345\205\203\344\270\215\351\243\275\345\222\214 (PUFA)\',\\n    isEssential: true,\\n    idealDailyIntake: \'\347\264\204 1.6 ~ 2.2 \345\205\213 / \345\244\251\',\\n    biologicalAction: \'\345\274\267\346\225\210\346\212\227\347\231\274\347\202\216 / \351\231\215\350\241\200\346\240\223\',\\n    modernIntakeStatus: \'\345\232\264\351\207\215\346\224\235\345\217\226\344\270\215\350\266\263\357\274\210\345\271\263\345\235\207\344\270\215\350\266\263 30%\357\274\211\',\\n    metabolicPathway: \'\347\266\223\344\272\272\351\253\224\351\205\265\347\264\240\350\275\211\345\214\226\347\202\272\346\212\227\347\231\274\347\202\216\345\211\215\345\210\227\350\205\272\347\264\240 (PGE3) \350\210\207\346\266\210\351\200\200\347\264\240 (Resolvins\343\200\201Protectins)\357\274\214\351\230\273\346\226\267\346\205\242\346\200\247\347\231\274\347\202\216\347\264\232\350\201\257\345\217\215\346\207\211\343\200\202\',\\n    keyMolecules: [\'ALA (\316\261-\344\272\236\351\272\273\351\205\270)\', \'EPA (\344\272\214\345\215\201\347\242\263\344\272\224\347\203\257\351\205\270)\', \'DHA (\344\272\214\345\215\201\344\272\214\347\242\263\345\205\255\347\203\257\351\205\270)\'],\\n    primaryFoodSources: [\'\344\272\236\351\272\273\344\273\201\346\262\271 (55% ALA)\', \'\347\264\253\350\230\207\347\261\275\346\262\271 (60% ALA)\', \'\345\215\260\345\212\240\346\236\234\346\262\271\', \'\346\240\270\346\241\203\', \'\346\267\261\346\265\267\345\257\214\350\204\202\351\255\232\351\241\236 (\351\256\255\351\255\232/\351\257\226\351\255\232)\'],\\n    healthBenefits: [\\n      \'\351\231\215\344\275\216\350\241\200\346\266\262\344\270\255\344\270\211\351\205\270\347\224\230\346\262\271\351\205\257\357\274\214\346\270\233\345\260\221\345\213\225\350\204\210\347\262\245\347\213\200\347\241\254\345\214\226\346\226\221\345\241\212\346\262\211\347\251\215\',\\n      \'\346\212\221\345\210\266\344\277\203\347\231\274\347\202\216\347\264\260\350\203\236\346\277\200\347\264\240 (TNF-\316\261, IL-6)\357\274\214\347\267\251\350\247\243\351\227\234\347\257\200\347\202\216\350\210\207\351\201\216\346\225\217\345\217\215\346\207\211\',\\n      \'\347\266\255\346\214\201\345\244\247\350\205\246\347\232\256\350\263\252\347\245\236\347\266\223\347\252\201\350\247\270\346\265\201\345\213\225\346\200\247\357\274\214\346\217\220\345\215\207\350\252\215\347\237\245\346\225\217\351\212\263\345\272\246\350\210\207\350\246\226\347\266\262\350\206\234\345\201\245\345\272\267\',\\n      \'\350\252\277\347\257\200\345\277\203\345\276\213\357\274\214\351\231\215\344\275\216\345\277\203\345\256\244\346\200\247\345\277\203\345\276\213\344\270\215\346\225\264\345\217\212\345\277\203\345\233\240\346\200\247\347\214\235\346\255\273\351\242\250\351\232\252\'\\n    ],\\n    clinicalRisksOfImbalance: \'\347\274\272\344\271\217\346\231\202\346\230\223\350\252\230\347\231\274\345\205\250\350\272\253\346\200\247\344\275\216\345\272\246\346\205\242\346\200\247\347\231\274\347\202\216\343\200\201\345\212\240\351\200\237\350\241\200\347\256\241\347\241\254\345\214\226\343\200\201\347\232\256\350\206\232\344\271\276\347\207\245\350\204\253\345\261\221\343\200\201\346\203\205\347\267\222\347\204\246\346\205\256\350\210\207\346\263\250\346\204\217\345\212\233\350\241\260\351\200\200\343\200\202\',\\n    cookingPrecaution: \'\345\214\226\345\255\270\347\265\220\346\247\213\345\220\253 3 \345\200\213\344\270\215\351\243\275\345\222\214\351\233\231\351\215\265\357\274\214\346\245\265\345\272\246\344\270\215\350\200\220\347\206\261\344\270\224\346\245\265\346\230\223\346\260\247\345\214\226\351\205\270\346\225\227\343\200\202\345\232\264\347\246\201\351\253\230\346\272\253\347\205\216\347\202\270\357\274\214\345\203\205\351\231\220\344\275\216\346\272\253\347\224\237\351\243\262\346\210\226\345\206\267\347\233\244\346\267\213\346\213\214\343\200\202\'\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'omega-6\',\\n    name: \'Omega-6 \350\204\202\350\202\252\351\205\270\',\\n    chemicalName: \'\344\272\236\351\272\273\346\262\271\351\205\270 (LA) / \350\212\261\347\224\237\345\233\233\347\203\257\351\205\270 (AA)\',\\n    category: \'Omega-6\',\\n    type: \'\345\244\232\345\205\203\344\270\215\351\243\275\345\222\214 (PUFA)\',\\n    isEssential: true,\\n    idealDailyIntake: \'\347\264\204 6 ~ 10 \345\205\213 / \345\244\251\357\274\210\345\273\272\350\255\260\350\210\207