 <ResearchHub />\\n      </main>\\n\\n      {/* Footer with Medical Disclaimers & References */}\\n      <Footer />\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Assemble all Healthy Oils Encyclopedia modules in App.tsx\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/App.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Writing App component\",\"toolSummary\":\"Update src/App.tsx\"}"
