    thinking: "**Reviewing Navbar Design**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` both passed flawlessly. I\'ve been focusing on the Navbar\'s design, specifically implementing those prominent, clean tab buttons as the initial step to address the user\'s prompt. I\'ve designed and integrated the large tab buttons in the `Navbar`.\n\n\n**Implementing Tabbed Navigation**\n\nI\'ve made significant headway implementing the tabbed navigation for both desktop and mobile views. I\'ve designed and integrated high-contrast, state-indicated tabs for the encyclopedia sections. I refactored `App.tsx` for a page-based structure and added a chapter pagination bar. The footer links now also seamlessly switch between tabs. Furthermore, I\'ve created the `HealthQuizLanding.tsx` featuring interactive questions for an engaging landing experience.\n\n\n"
